From 0130204aef7c71d4e84ebaa6d5dbf9fa663b2e28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:22:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Priorities: move onto the page structure (PrioritiesPage
 + PrioritiesPageContext)

PriorityMatrixPage becomes PrioritiesPage and renders BoardHeader itself; PrioritiesScreen is gone. The route shapes the matrix read with the pure adapter toPrioritiesPageProps (the no-plan week fallback), and the page's components read activePlanId, the open popover, the overlay openers and the Track / Done writes from PrioritiesPageContext instead of callback props. groupTasksByQuadrant and isTrackedTask join oneOffUtils with unit tests; FALLBACK_QUADRANT moves there too. The Design Console renders PrioritiesPage through the same adapter and wraps the MatrixTaskCard specimen and the mobile Move-to panel in inertPrioritiesPageContext.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pLaQcffbbgWyRsYruK
